{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119477","id":3686446288,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7burTQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119477/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119477/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0692b981ba044d63b5fea9dd1ee17851332e9ce8","number":119477,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add class filtering for the file system","user":{"login":"Quatumus","id":82884848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODg0ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82884848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus","html_url":"https://github.com/Quatumus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Addresses but not quite 1:1 with the original proposal #[11716](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11716)\r\n\r\n## How it works\r\n\r\nAll classes are listed and can be selected for filtering.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"813\" height=\"653\" alt=\"kuva\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f8f71f1-fdd1-46f6-9adc-5bde25a82c81\" />\r\n\r\nSelected classes are then added to this other list so that the user doesn't need to navigate the huge list every time. From this smaller list the classes can be quickly toggled on or off for filtering. If multiple classes are selected at the same time all files that match the filters are shown.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"459\" height=\"270\" alt=\"kuva\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93d2cf41-3ea5-4d90-8c49-2634be44e48a\" />\r\n\r\nIf the file system is in split mode the split view will show all files found recursively under the currently open folder.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"456\" height=\"411\" alt=\"kuva\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbb26415-2131-407d-9e66-78353192a4ad\" />\r\n\r\n## Overall\r\n\r\nThis is a feature that I have used quite a lot in unreal engine especially for managing large amounts of mesh assets for level building. This sort of file filtering should be very familiar to anyone who has used it in unreal as that is what I based this off of.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"mile